HsQ8HrTfaXIaFfBuO6kGC3tkVKtLZFm_iQDpxnp5lxyZGqdc0DefG9_pZ_3GQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRX2Wya2csoM5TZp58lCT2U1FpY7yu_8KHmedsMJ2p9JQ&oe=6B09AC05"}, {"file_name": "screenshot_iso_rear.png", "id": "1411892234022179", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820441_1411892237355512_533233947555522721_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PM438cslm-gQ7kNvwEam4QD&_nc_oc=AdqU2u6QiF2iLUw1fl84fUtzSa-GED72Brw880qvBiMBTzA260y6Sm82hBau6OYZ5yE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR9vZybCxchNJ1G-HHTatRcYEzuaLN56rcTarzQfSaaOg&oe=6B099C67"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Pixel Blocks", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Pixel Blocks revolutionizes VR gaming by combining **intuitive voxel creation** with **seamless multiplayer collaboration**.\n\n### Core Features\n\n- **Infinite Worlds**: Explore and build in massively scalable environments\n- **Real-Time Collaboration**: Build with friends instantly with zero lag\n- **GPU-Accelerated Rendering**: Thousands of blocks without performance issues\n- **Advanced Networking**: Instant synchronization across all players\n- **Built-In Voice Chat**: Immersive team communication without breaking immersion\n\n### Perfect For\n\n- Creative gamers and artists\n- Educators and students\n- Social communities and friend groups\n- Content creators and streamers\n\nPixelBlock transforms VR into a canvas for collaborative creativity.", "short_description": "Pixel Blocks is a collaborative VR voxel-building game where players create and explore shared worlds together in real-time. Use natural hand gestures to place and paint colorful blocks, build massive structures, and collaborate with friends instantly. Featuring cross-platform multiplayer, voice chat, optimized performance, and infinite scalability. Create, collaborate, and inspire on Meta Quest and compatible VR platforms.